\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Protocol $\times $ head, Wilson 95\% intervals, \textbf  {deployment stack only}. The memorized head leads on \emph  {dev} and collapses on held-out and randomized; the released head is flat across all three. Our free per-tick regression baseline, same trunk and corpus regime, scores 0/56 (red rule). The audit-stack control is deliberately \emph  {not} plotted here --- see Figure~\ref {fig:auditstack}.}}{8}{figure.caption.18}\protected@file@percent }
